  "$comment": [
    "GoMesh publishes on meshcore/<CODE>/<pubkey>/<stream>, where <CODE> is the",
    "airport identifier of the uplink gateway's metro - NOT the node's own position.",
    "Use it only as a group-level hint for observers that never publish coordinates.",
    "Any code absent from this table is treated as out-of-area and its observers are",
    "excluded from the directory, the region hierarchy and every count.",
    "confidence=observed: seen on mqtt.gomesh.dev and cross-checked against the",
    "  polygon-derived group of at least one located observer publishing under it.",
    "confidence=anticipated: an airport identifier inside a county in",
    "  regions/us-ca-bay-area.geojson, not yet observed on the broker. Listed so a",
    "  new gateway does not silently drop its observers as out-of-area.",
    "Groups must match REGION_GROUP_PROPERTY values in the boundary file."
  ],
